<p>The <a href="https://careeragents.org/blog/pay-someone-to-apply-for-jobs/" rel="nofollow noopener" class="font-semibold text-brand-700 underline">Career Agents</a> figure is a vendor's statement about its own market. We re-fetched the page on November 12, 2026 and the figure is there; the page shows dollar signs but does not name a currency or a country version. The same page states an application-only range of $150 to $700 a month, coaches at $75 to $550 an hour, and resume writers at $200 to $700.</p>
<p><a href="https://mypersonalrecruiter.com/can-you-hire-someone-to-find-you-a-job/" rel="nofollow noopener" class="font-semibold text-brand-700 underline">My Personal Recruiter</a> states $50 to $300 a month for application services and $2,000 to $5,000 a month for reverse recruiters. That page is dated April 23, 2026, and we fetched it on November 12, 2026. It shows dollar signs and does not name a currency.</p>
